    gameTips:
    - Swipe or select two Blobsters in the same row or column.
    - Blobsters only eat a different color.
    - Rocks stop a moving Blobster on the tile before them.
    - Trail Blobsters leave a Blobster behind on each tile they depart.
    - Capture the matching Flag after clearing the other Blobsters.
    - Ghosts haunt back toward where their victim began.
    - Graves clear a haunting Ghost; a Blobster on the Grave survives.
    - Undo restores the previous board-changing move.
    - Restart resets the puzzle and clears its history.
